## ObjectType: Energy Site

Local operational object; source concept reference does not assert OWL equivalence.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| site_id | Site id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | site_id |
| customer_id | Customer id | string | Explicit foreign-key association; blank creates no edge. | customer_id |
| name | Name | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | name |
| region | Region | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | region |
| region_code | Region code | string | Stable English code; paired display field is localized. | region_code |
| response_cap_kw | Response cap kw | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | response_cap_kw |

